WEBVTT

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:23.910
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:31.250
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:38.980
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:45.120
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.900
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:57.670
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:04.650
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:12.580
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:20.250
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.050
Oh, no! I'm late!

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.310
Wait, I'm off
duty today.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.250
Morning.

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.550
Morning. You're
up early.

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.850
I just woke
up.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.400
Want some coffee?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:57.200
Yeah. Think I will.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:02.210
Wow. They say the leaves are changing.

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:06.730
Yeah, fall's here, I guess.

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:15.720
So...

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.220
Hmm?

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.960
What are you doing today?
Hmm?

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.860
Nothing special.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.660
But it's your day off.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.960
Yeah.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.700
Maybe I'll do the cleaning.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.230
How about the farewell party?

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.370
I'm going. Sure.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:34.170
Oh.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:39.170
FILE. 48
THE END
OF SUMMER

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.240
With the approach of Fall
Traffic Safety Week...

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.210
...this is the time of year when
people become most careless.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:50.620
I want everyone to try
harder than ever.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:51.950
Sir!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:58.320
Also, today we will hold a farewell party for
Toukairin, to whom we are very indebted.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.650
I want everyone who's
free to attend.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:02.790
Sir!

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.830
Are you going to the farewell party?

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.940
Sure!

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:09.530
I'll probably just make it back in time.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.840
It seems like he only just got here.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.640
Yeah, we were just getting to know him.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.010
Look you guys, I bought him a present.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:18.950
Hey, so did I!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:19.810
Really?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:24.440
So he's off to the Himalayas.
That's going to be tough.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.890
I envy him.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.480
What do you mean?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:31.460
You have to be a strong person
to follow your dreams.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:36.520
Somehow I always end up agreeing
with what you say.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.220
Don't be silly.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.730
Tsujimoto's going
to miss him.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.060
They were such good
rivals.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.610
Does she seem depressed?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.480
Actually...

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.650
Mm-hmm?

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.310
She really doesn't.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.880
What a great day!

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.500
Oh, hi.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.360
You're here already? You've got a
long wait before the party begins.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.870
I wanted to say good-bye
to some people.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.010
Oh.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.040
Here, I'll carry those for you.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.050
Thanks. I'm just going
down there.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:28.150
Where's Natsumi?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.950
She's off-duty today.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:35.020
Yeah, but she'll be coming
to the party, of course.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.350
Oh.

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:39.300
Lieutenant?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.030
Yes?

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:43.190
Are you... uh...

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.360
Nothing.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:51.040
Toukairin. You made it.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.210
Hello. Nice to see you.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.610
So you're deserting us.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.710
Don't give up halfway
and slink back.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.350
Lieutenant Toukairin!

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.320
Hello.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.950
Lieutenant Toukairin's here!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:02.980
Oh, yea!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.180
Made it on time!

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.720
When should we give these to him?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.020
I don't know!

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.020
"Bokuto Cafeteria"

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:15.250
And that's the way it was! That reminds
me, where's Tsujimoto?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.830
You're right.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.460
She's still not here.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.390
She's late.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.700
I hope she didn't have an accident.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.840
We'd be the first to know since we're the police.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.060
Yeah, I guess.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.860
Maybe she had some
things to do first.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.930
Hmm.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:01.910
I know we'd like to wait, but we
really have to get started.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:04.450
Yeah, some people have to go on duty tonight.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.650
I'll go get Toukairin.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.640
Good idea. Thanks.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.150
Lieutenant! We're
ready to start.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.320
Uh... Okay.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.860
Sorry, but Natsumi's late.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.560
Oh.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.330
I wonder what's taking
her so long?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:27.940
First of
all...

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:33.970
A toast to the extended leave Lieutenant
Toukairin's getting... and we're not!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.940
Cheers!

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.920
I came.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:31.430
I don't know.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.970
What am I doing,
anyway?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.770
"Ikenaga"
What am I doing,
anyway?

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:40.070
I know I've got to put
on a bright face...

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.300
...and send
him off.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:02.230
I'm really sorry. I don't know
what happened to Natsumi.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:06.070
I'll wait a little longer,
if it's okay.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:12.300
I'm sure she's going to come. We
still have a rivalry to settle.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.770
Maybe I'm taking this
too seriously.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:18.570
Not at all. Natsumi
hates losing.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:21.380
She sure does.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:27.110
Chief?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.660
What are you still
doing here?

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.760
Just waiting for Natsumi.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.160
Just waiting for Natsumi.
Well, Toukairin?

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:38.730
How about a little
one-on-one?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.940
They call you the "Praying
Mantis of Bokuto."

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.170
I'm flattered to hear
that you know that.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.310
Uh...

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.620
"Sound Mind"

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.470
You're late!

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.510
We've been waiting.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.810
We've been waiting.
Sorry.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:28.240
That's okay.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.010
Come on.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:31.990
What for?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.850
Shh...

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.020
Huh?

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.520
Is that?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.690
"Section Chief"

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.630
"Toukairin"

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.720
You beat me.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:43.560
You did well, Lieutenant.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.470
You're late.

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:50.560
I'm sorry.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:54.560
It's not me you should be apologizing
to. Kobayakawa?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.700
Yes?

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.770
Can you put on some tea?

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.070
Yes.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:02.570
Wait. Uh...

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:11.320
I haven't seen such a good
match in a long time.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.280
Detective, you
flatter me.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:26.470
Can you come with me?

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.630
Huh?

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.460
I meant, I know a good
place to go.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:35.940
So you drew him in and caught
him with his forearm.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.410
<i>"Point!"</i>

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:44.590
It was a perfect hit.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:45.650
No.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:46.490
Hmm?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.290
Well, just before I got him...

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:48.960
Huh?

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.390
He got me.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.290
Ow.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:54.560
Chief!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:01.160
I'm getting old.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:19.590
Beer?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.490
Not enough?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.820
This is the place you
wanted to bring me?

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.550
Don't you like it?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.820
I love it!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.590
Cheers!
Cheers!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.400
Here!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.170
Hmm?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:07.300
Full moon.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.310
It's been there this whole time.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:12.300
I just noticed it.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:19.780
You're not very observant. You'd better be
more alert when you're in the mountains.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.650
Aren't I observant?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.290
Not a bit.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:24.350
Like how?

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.910
What do you mean, "like how?"

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.790
You're leaving tomorrow,
right?

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.460
Drink up! It's
the last one!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.530
How about fighting
me for it?

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.410
How?

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.200
How?
An arm wrestle, of course!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:49.000
The winner gets
the last beer.

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.170
You're on!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.290
A full moon!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.500
Ready...

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.500
Go!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:38.920
You got me.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:42.330
All right! I won! For
the first time!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.670
This is our last
time, huh?

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:52.270
Yeah. Now there's nothing
for us to regret.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:53.880
I...

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.240
I...
Hmm?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:55.310
Hmm?

00:14:55.310 --> 00:15:02.120
I like your name... Natsumi.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.310
Huh?

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:11.680
I've had a good time
with you. Really.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.820
Good-bye.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.570
Thanks a lot.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.500
Natsumi!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.310
Yeah?

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.370
Last night...

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:28.200
Oh. We had a ton of beer,
then I came home.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.100
Did you have
a good time?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.910
Sure. Why do
you ask?

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.110
Sorry.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:39.380
What? You're
acting weird.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.950
Really weird.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.220
Look out! Coming
through!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.440
Hey everybody!
Tea time!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:03.910
How about a
little break?

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.180
Your turn to make tea,
huh, Tsujimoto?

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:11.580
You got it! Nothing better than a nice hot
cup of tea to get you through a hot day!

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.520
You've got to
have some!

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.360
I'll help.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.460
Me, too.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:17.590
Here you are, Chief.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:20.330
Oh. Thanks.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.430
Uh... Chief?

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.900
Hmm?

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:28.830
It happened last night. The swelling
still hasn't gone down.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.480
Chief!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.450
What is it?

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:16.450
If it's all right with you, sir, I'd like
permission to take some lost time.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.260
Natsumi?

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.040
See you later.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.910
See you, Natsumi.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:07.570
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:15.100
<i>When the bell of destiny rings.</i>
<i>the door should open.</i>

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.620
Excuse me, sir?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:37.070
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.640
"New Tokyo International
Airport Terminal 2"

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:45.400
I still want to keep feeling my
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:53.210
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:59.350
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:04.290
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:10.730
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.370
You're a liar!

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:12.930
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.670
You let me win, on purpose!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:15.740
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:18.610
Think that makes me feel good? Well it doesn't!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:18.970
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:19.240
So much for our last battle!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.640
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.280
Now we've got lots of things to regret!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.780
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.180
Idiot!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:32.550
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:34.220
You came all this way just to say that?

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:34.360
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.760
That's right! I left early! Abandoned my duties!

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:41.860
<i>The dream you have by yourself will be</i>
<i>far betterwhen dreamed by two.</i>

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:42.960
What?

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:43.100
<i>The dream you have by yourself will be</i>
<i>far betterwhen dreamed by two.</i>

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.270
Your nose.

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:49.270
<i>Don't waste time wandering around.</i>

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:49.970
I didn't let you win. You won fair and square.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:53.940
<i>You have to cheer yourself up all</i>
<i>the time and be decisive.</i>

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:54.810
Come on!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:55.180
<i>You have to cheer yourself up all</i>
<i>the time and be decisive.</i>

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:56.810
I wouldn't lie.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:56.950
<i>You have to cheer yourself up all</i>
<i>the time and be decisive.</i>

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.350
What about last night?

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.950
<i>You have to cheer yourself up all</i>
<i>the time and be decisive.</i>

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:01.950
Let me tell you something... I...

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.620
<i>Be very positive, pull your-</i>
<i>self together.</i>

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.150
Wait a second.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:05.290
<i>Be very positive, pull your-</i>
<i>self together.</i>

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:08.060
I'm going to tell you. So just let me, all right?

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:08.120
<i>Be very positive, pull your-</i>
<i>self together.</i>

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.020
I'm going to come right out with it.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.030
<i>I know I'll love somebody. I always believe</i>
<i>in myself, that I will get my chance.</i>

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:13.830
What was it you wouldn't tell me last night?

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:14.530
<i>I know I'll love somebody. I always believe</i>
<i>in myself, that I will get my chance.</i>

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:16.870
No! I won't let a woman say it first!

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:18.100
<i>When the bell of destiny rings,</i>
<i>the door should be open.</i>

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:22.140
What difference does it make?! I...

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:23.740
<i>When the bell of destiny rings,</i>
<i>the door should be open.</i>

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:31.470
<i>I know I'll love somebody. I'm sure I can find</i>
<i>that someone I've been looking for.</i>

